  "prompt": "A complete adorable emerald green baby dragon, full body, standing upright on two broad three-toed feet. Large rounded head, expressive amber eyes, short smiling muzzle, two swept ivory horns and small dorsal spines. Rounded belly with pale cream segmented plates. Two short arms held apart from the torso, relaxed three-clawed hands. Two broad bat-like wings attached behind the shoulders, spread sideways with visible green membranes and sturdy spars, separated from arms and body. One long tapering tail extending backward in a gentle curve, separated from the legs. Fine pebbled scales, subtle color variation, believable thickness and polished animated-film craftsmanship. Symmetric neutral pose. No fur, clothes, pedestal, props, text, additional characters or scenery.",
  "resolution": 1024,
  "rights": "User requested a new standalone dragon and motions after approving the previous generated examples. Original text direction; no reference image upload. Generated hidden surfaces and locally authored creature rig are assumptions. Provider account terms apply; commercial rights not independently verified. This job is mesh+texture only; local wing/tail rigging and motions are recorded separately. Exact user request: I like this!!! Can you end to end create a dragon for me + have motions.",
